rustpaper-panel

The panel takes its look from the Horizon launcher (https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon,
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Ludovic Marie and the Horizon contributors):

- src/scene.rs ports the launcher's pixel sunset (launcher/src/scene.rs): its model, seeds and colour
  sums, and its blur, as they are.
- src/theme.rs follows horizon_theme::glass (colours, text and fill opacities, corners) and the
  launcher's glass_ui.rs (sizes of rows, tabs, buttons, fields and switches).
- assets/horizon-64.png is Horizon's mark (crates/horizon-theme/icons).

Fonts (assets/fonts), under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-*.txt beside them): Geist and Geist
Mono (Vercel), Bricolage Grotesque (Mathieu Triay), as the launcher ships them.

Icons (assets/icons): Hugeicons' free set, MIT (LICENSE-hugeicons.txt).
